sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User/Browser
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant GL as GitLab API

    U->>FE: Öffnet "Versionen" eines Projekts
    FE->>BE: GET /projects/:projectId/versions  (Authorization: app_token)
    BE->>BE: Validiert app_token -> resolve gitlab_access_token

    BE->>GL: GET /projects/:projectId/repository/tree?ref=default_branch&recursive=false
    GL-->>BE: [ {type,name,path}, ... ]

loop Für relevante Pfade (z.B. /resources, /modules, /systems, /packages)
BE->>GL: GET /projects/:projectId/repository/tree?path=<pfad>&ref=default_branch&recursive=true
GL-->>BE: [ Nodes ... ]
BE->>BE: Ableiten: resourceName, title, resourceType, isMainSystem (Flag/Heuristik), Letzte Änderung
BE->>GL: GET /projects/:projectId/repository/commits?path=<itemPath>&ref_name=default_branch&per_page=1
GL-->>BE: [{ committed_date }]
end

BE-->>FE: 200 [ {resourceName, title, resourceType, isMainSystem, lastModified} ... ]
FE-->>U: Tabelle mit Filtern
